 "_lane": "Ifrit (FFX aeon; the hunched horned beast; the possessed Ifrit of Chapter III link 3 and a summon in eleven more chapters): one costume across idle, attack, cast, hurt and KO (palette 0.94 to 1.00), so the idle's painting is the costume and the other poses are bent from it. Cut by polygons and the underlaps (no SAM): the two tails (an upper curved spike and a lower thick curl), the far arm and the far leg (dark), the near leg, the body (torso, back mane, hips and the near arm, which hangs in front of the knee) and the head with its horns. The head may translate a little (offset 0.06, covered by a 60 px skirt of head pixels under the body; a bigger one opened a hole at the neck in every blend) and nothing but the four leg bones scales. Game case: FFX only (an FFX aeon's painting set); the rig stays OFF. EXPRESSIVE KEYS (rig-expressive-2 lane, 2026-10-19): the attack and hurt head and far arm pieces are cut from Grothia's own attack and hurt paintings (Ifrit-x's polygons moved by the twin registration, 60 px at 1x = 120 master px).",
